    "materialsAndTechniques": "Colour lithograph",
    "objectHistory": "At the time of collection, it was recorded as 'anonymous' as the poster is unsigned. However, it has later been attributed to Igumnov who was a graphic designer and head of the Bureau of Trade Promotion within the All-Union Chamber of Commerce who oversaw the production of Intourist advertising.",
